libopus 1.5.2 (BSD-3-Clause, COPYING), for ducktape-av's feature `call`;
`../build.rs` compiles every .c here with `cc` (no cmake, no autotools).

From https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/opus/opus-1.5.2.tar.gz
sha256 65c1d2f78b9f2fb20082c38cbe47c951ad5839345876e46941612ee87f9a7ce1

Taken: the .c files celt_sources.mk, silk_sources.mk and opus_sources.mk
list in CELT_SOURCES, SILK_SOURCES, SILK_SOURCES_FLOAT, OPUS_SOURCES and
OPUS_SOURCES_FLOAT, and every .h in include/, celt/, silk/, silk/float/ and
src/. Left out: the SIMD directories (arm, x86, mips), fixed point, dnn
(deep PLC, DRED, OSCE: off unless ENABLE_* is defined), tests, tools.

Another version: the same, from its tarball, and the version in
`../build.rs`'s PACKAGE_VERSION.
